{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46916","headline":"荆门疾中喜谢尊师自南岳来相里秀才自京至 · 齐己","name":"荆门疾中喜谢尊师自南岳来相里秀才自京至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲堂昼卧眼初开，强起徐行遶砌苔。\n鹤氅人从衡岳至，鹑衣客自洛阳来。\n坐闻邻树栖幽鸟，吟觉江云发早雷。\n西笑东游此相别，两途消息待谁回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}